I made use of and edited the Greek Inscriptions in Space and Time (GIST) dataset from Kaše, V., Heřmánková, P.& Sobotková, A. (2023). GIST (Version v1.1) [Dataset]. Zenodo. https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.10139110. Theirs is a CC BY 4.0 license. It is very large and i am not sure if sharing it here is a good idea.
